 at  home or away and I think that's where  it's hard for people to figure out and  I'm always listen I lived it and I was  part of it so I'm I'm careful not to to  throw people under the bus but the  reality is it's unacceptable right and  it's uh it's disappointing I'm you know  I didn't talk to Polly much we just  texted probably what were your feelings  all of it I think it was shocking how it  played out in real time not just that  the USA lost to Trinidad Tobago but  certain other things had to play out in  real time with other national squads to  keep us out of it so you know a half an  hour earlier it didn't feel urgent and  then you're like it's really happening  and then you're sitting there after the  match going oh the next five years  there's really nothing to talk about  with USA soccer yeah that's a point  because it's even for the last ten  minutes it didn't we were still in the  World Cup and then all of a sudden the  next thing you know Panama scores and  you're just trying to wrap your mind  around wow this is really happening and  you kind of feel like you're in a fog it  was a perfect storm I mean Panama score  in the last few minutes on Duras beat  Mexico which you would never expect we  have a crazy own goal that goes in off  Omar Gonzales and the guy hits a shot of  his life from Trinidad and so but I  guess the bigger point is you can't put  yourself in that fits the situation and  that's what they did you think Mexico's  enjoying this well then four years ago  Mexico were out of the World Cup looking  in on the last day we went to Panama and  or the US team went to Panama and if  they beat Panama Mexico would qualify  for the World Cup  we had already qualified and we ended up  eating Panama did them a favor  last night Mexico unfortunately did not  return the favor so I'm sure there are  large slots of their population that are  happy with it but I got a lot of tweets  or in messages from people saying I'm  Mexican and mexican-american and I'm  really sad that we're not gonna see the  u.s. in the World Cup it makes the World  Cup more fun and more exciting so just  it's a sad day I'll talk to you in four  years okay appreciate so kind of yet  thank you Landon that's the great Landon  Donovan the Dan Patrick show weekday  mornings on audience
 

